        "original_id": "5f5cc52c-d153-5e78-b682-e4ca56b379a1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lloyd Banks, 50 Cent, Tony Yayo\n- Projects: The Cold Corner 2\n- Organizations: G-Unit\n- Topics: hip hop\n\nFacts:\n- Christopher Charles Lloyd was born on April 30, 1982, and he is better known by the stage name Lloyd Banks.\n- Lloyd Banks is an American hip hop recording artist.\n- Lloyd Banks is a member of the East Coast hip hop group G-Unit alongside his childhood friends 50 Cent and Tony Yayo.\n- The Cold Corner 2 is the eleventh mixtape by American rapper Lloyd Banks.\n- The Cold Corner 2 was released for free download on November 8, 2011.",
